{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intelektronica is a game, which is a world simulator that allows any choice of gameplay. There are three worlds available in the game, such as the Fantasy world, the Present Times and the far future. In each of the worlds there are factions that we can fight against or join. A system of trust points is responsible for contacts with individual factions, which we earn, for example, by fighting the opposing faction or completing missions. In open world mode, missions are quests that are available as trust points increase. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3416300?t=1747583719","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3416300?t=1747583719","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416300/1d47c861693d2d6ccabaa4b901ae1ae622c6981d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747583719","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416300/1d47c861693d2d6ccabaa4b901ae1ae622c6981d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747583719","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intelektronica is a game, which is a world simulator that allows any choice of gameplay. There are three worlds available in the game, such as the Fantasy world, the Present Times and the far future. In each of the worlds there are factions that we can fight against or join. A system of trust points is responsible for contacts with individual factions, which we earn, for example, by fighting the opposing faction or completing missions. In open world mode, missions are quests that are available as trust points increase. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["RingoGames"],"gen